/*
 * PAGE BRIEF -- /pages/audiobook-player-for-the-elderly
 *
 * Audience   Adults buying a simple audiobook player, for themselves or for a
 *            parent or grandparent. Search terms: "audiobook player for the
 *            elderly", "simple audiobook player for seniors", "talking book
 *            player". NOT a children's audience -- no child imagery, no child copy.
 * Ad group   Accessible & Adult Listeners (Google Ads, built paused 11 Sep 2026).
 * Promise    A player with five buttons and no screen. Nothing to set up.
 * Offer      The player, /products/audiobook-player-elderly, GBP 39.99-49.99.
 *            Then the adult classics collection at GBP 15.99 a title.
 * CTA        "See the player" -> /products/audiobook-player-elderly (senior template).
 *
 * WHY THIS SHAPE
 *   The old page opened with ~900 words of essay and put the offer below it. 201
 *   people in the last period produced 3 carts and 1 purchase. The essay is kept,
 *   for the organic traffic it earns, but it now sits below the offer and carries
 *   the H1 via main-page.
 *
 * DELIBERATELY ABSENT
 *   - Testimonials. Every review in the theme is a parent talking about a child.
 *     None is usable here. Do not borrow the children's quotes.
 *   - Any accessibility or medical claim (sight loss, dementia, arthritis). The
 *     product has not been validated for these and the bank has no source for them.
 *   - The Older Listeners Starter Pack. Its three books are The Butterfly Lion,
 *     Kid Normal and The Train to Impossible Places -- guide age 8+. It is a pack
 *     for older CHILDREN, not for adults, and must not be sold from this page.
 *
 * RISK  Adult classics stock is 1-5 units a title, ~58 units across 31 titles.
 *       Paid traffic will exhaust individual titles. Check before raising budget.
 *
 * Copy is governed by content/messaging.yml. Run bin/check-page.py before merge.
 */
